# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day29

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| derive | 얻다, 비롯되다 | Many medicines are derived from plants. |
| alter | 변경하다 | Environmental changes can alter ecosystems. |
| consequently | 결과적으로 | The temperature increased; consequently, water levels decreased. |

---

## Synonyms

### derive
→ obtain / originate from

### alter
→ change / modify

### consequently
→ therefore / as a result

---

## Useful Collocations

derive benefits from
→ ~로부터 이익을 얻다

alter the environment
→ 환경을 변화시키다

consequently lead to
→ 결과적으로 ~로 이어지다

